sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant UI as React Shell
    participant Module as WorkRecords or owning module
    participant Auth as Authorization
    participant Id as Identity
    participant Org as Organization
    participant Audit as Audit

    User->>UI: Open record
    UI->>Module: Get record (id)
    Module->>Module: Build trusted RecordFacts
    Module->>Auth: DecideAccess(action, actor, RecordFacts)
    Auth->>Id: ResolveActiveIdentity
    Id-->>Auth: Account state
    Auth->>Org: ResolveOrganizationScope
    Org-->>Auth: Active organizational scope
    Auth->>Auth: Apply capability + relationship + classification + record state
    Auth->>Auth: Apply field access template
    Auth-->>Module: Allow fields A and B, hide field C
    alt Sensitive access required by policy
        Module->>Audit: Record sensitive access
        Audit-->>Module: Audited
    end
    Module-->>UI: Authorized response only
    UI-->>User: Show allowed fields
